# raw recovery/forensic artifacts — never committed.
# NOTE: the pattern is `.audit/*`, NOT `.audit/`. Ignoring the directory itself
# stops git descending into it, and the negation below would never be reached.
.audit/*

# EXCEPTION: contributor provenance is durable evidence about someone else's
# authorship, not raw forensic noise. Losing it would silently erase credit,
# so it is versioned on purpose.
!.audit/contributions/

# editor/OS noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
